{"candidateAnswer":"three","evidence":"[D1:2 | 1:47 pm on 18 May, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam! Good to see you! Yeah, I just got back from a trip with my family in my new Prius.\n[D1:4 | 1:47 pm on 18 May, 2023] Evan: My old prius broke down, decided to get it repaired and sell it. Glad you asked, we went to Rockies, check it out.","itemId":"urn:uuid:498d5ab6-1a89-5056-9ad6-503b6c6323ed","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:b57bbcaaac50710b8a11991e3624d7433f030c44e31cd1e803a874b822754df6","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How many Prius has Evan owned?","referenceAnswer":"two","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"b57bbcaaac50710b8a11991e3624d7433f030c44e31cd1e803a874b822754df6"}}]}